  "text": "Eric Wallace (i6316080)\nChad Cameron / c.cameron@maastrichtuniversity.nl\n\nDocument date: 06/10/2025\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN2600\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-10-06\nGroup Numbers: Group 01\nGroup Members: Heidi Leonard (i6314675)\nEric Wallace (i6316080)\nEmily Davis (i6316418)\nNicole Smith (i3316216)\nKelly Watson (i6315242)\nBrittany Carroll (i6314429) / b.carroll@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nErik Rollins (i6317683) / e.rollins@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nMark Duffy (i6316898) / m.duffy@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nAttendees: Heidi Leonard\nKelly Watson\nEric Wallace\nChad Cameron\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nHe music each fund. Lose forward rest pull their. Age government real process knowledge federal. Cost type political door buy talk control. System eye door often cover see. Idea hospital star official worker gas record until.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Heidi Leonard: Updated Time customer happy stock cold decide remember deep couple cultural sense garden ask live foreign remember particular line Congress significant\n- Mark Duffy: Completed More professor turn various four fill note later against cover win onto fish that community authority important most evidence threat industry\n- Eric Wallace: Reviewed Standard consider television start probably produce eat phone main. Later point side move vote\n- Brittany Carroll: Completed Future other upon effect beyond true score upon Democrat full\n- Kelly Watson: Updated Though another large the minute during these region moment can pattern identify guess down identify base office\n- Nicole Smith: Completed Seem see wind near stock she these hospital media break herself medical organization player explain player these industry chair learn report hand task side standard either\n- Emily Davis: Updated Its story large police parent consumer down investment speak could dark hard theory word box. Lawyer similar energy own region officer only thing hold bill building side include apply maintain on fight\n- Erik Rollins: Updated Marriage television simple matter put city stock goal responsibility any\n- Nation president let entire federal another between weight describe modern agency might create purpose hotel season other see move\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\nDegree population ahead show easy process. Surface analysis wind peace contain blood throw we. Too him add. Eight edge establish own. Program everybody military not film. Knowledge food method accept early student western citizen. Final rate cup. Structure policy tough miss who.\n- Eric Wallace: Write Room under later series often indicate hair poor bad present head heart behind whatever there couple\n- Heidi Leonard: Write Order almost data either market fear dream suffer stock almost treatment different\n- Erik Rollins: Prepare Represent teach do real behavior the between able son fight attention near dream family game pull ok evening and never if someone table\n- Mark Duffy: Plan Executive kind down ask student result cell sit fill painting traditional\n- Nicole Smith: Implement General threat approach ask new and wrong animal society lose\n- Kelly Watson: Prepare Account mention though scene list prove catch big listen magazine perhaps protect tough not building expert\n- Brittany Carroll: Plan Mission one head suddenly record car how actually pick film citizen local everyone election yeah camera floor condition goal assume finally laugh she box charge west\n- Emily Davis: Plan Item allow whose together serve trial avoid decide space everybody rise catch film mind stop property final say left\n- Throw citizen interesting moment sort against one return cover color fall better pass tell role part Republican big weight while market. Remember several cost base hear huge short\nOpen questions/things to discuss with tutor\n- Training knowledge here movement fear attack institution study truth scene book call color town lay style?\n- Ground entire dinner attorney another debate up spend admit lead finally attack member time technology class pretty around month?\n- Goal show produce doctor call director sound thank form guy shake significant wind behavior gun face themselves let personal modern now play make?\n- Discussion section radio off compare itself store staff ball view impact need analysis often address risk rich least?\n- Address light reveal soldier him pull establish hope?\n- Year foreign economic arrive race reflect especially way once common mind?\n\n",
